    <body>
      <div><head n="1">Introduction</head>
        <p><s coords="2,10,10,100,10">Compound X reduced inflammation in mice <ref type="bibr" target="#b0" coords="2,50,10,10,10">[1]</ref>.</s> <s>Other work agrees <ref type="bibr" target="#b1">[2]</ref>-<ref type="bibr" target="#b3">[4]</ref>.</s> <s>A bundle follows <ref type="bibr" target="#b0">[1, 3-4]</ref>.</s> <s>See <ref type="figure" target="#fig_0">Fig. 1</ref> for details.</s></p>
      </div>
      <div><head n="2">Results</head>
        <p>Serum IL-6 fell by 12% (Smith et al. <ref type="bibr" target="#b1">2019</ref>). The effect was not seen at low doses.</p>
      </div>
